The vendored copy in crates/sparrow was adapted for use as a library:
the upstream CLI binary, benchmark binary, SVG exporter and the
ctrl-c/fern/clap utilities were removed; the optimization core
(exploration, compression, separation, sampling, quantification)
is unmodified.

